Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. DeGhoster is a native Win32 application that links only against Windows
system libraries (comctl32, dwmapi, uxtheme, gdiplus, shell32, user32, gdi32).
Toolbar and list icons are glyphs from the "Segoe MDL2 Assets" font that ships
with Windows; no icon assets are bundled or redistributed.
